kokoro-zh-v1 -- Mandarin voice package for the app "Hoc Tieng Trung"

This folder is a trimmed redistribution of third-party files. Nothing here was
trained or recorded by the app authors.

1. Kokoro-82M-v1.1-zh (hexgrad) -- Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)
   https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M-v1.1-zh
2. sherpa-onnx export "kokoro-int8-multi-lang-v1_1" (k2-fsa / Xiaomi Corp.):
   int8 ONNX model, tokens.txt, lexicon-zh.txt, phone/date/number-zh.fst --
   Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)
   https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/tag/tts-models
3. espeak-ng-data (subset: phontab, phonindex, phondata, intonations, en_dict, lang/gmw/en-US) from eSpeak NG --
   GNU GPL version 3 or later (see LICENSE-espeak-ng)
   https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng

Modifications (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)):
- voices.bin keeps only speakers 34 (zf_059, female) and
  77 (zm_050, male) of the original 103, stored as index 0 and 1.
- model.int8.onnx: only the metadata entries n_speakers, speaker_names,
  speaker2id and id2speaker were rewritten to match voices.bin; the network
  weights and graph are byte-identical to the original.
- English lexicons, the jieba dict/ folder and the other espeak-ng languages
  were removed (the app reads Chinese only).
